        <p>Large size and gcod quality, 6d. FdRNIIuRT CREAM ava gives a brilliant gloss to all kinds of hiatiogan,,ur. French-polished Furniture with half the usual is tivaranteed :tot to show finger marks. 6d. bottle tor 4d. is. bottle for 7d. MORGAN'S GOLD PAINT tore. as used by Cab net Makers, Gliders and Decor4,lo- --las the original qrightness of Gold, easy of aPP" tion, and unrivllled in appearance. Boots reduced price— is. bottle tor 7d. 1 BOOTS kjASII CHEMISTS, THE LARGEST, BEST, AND CHEAPSSI.• 35, BRIDGE-STREET, 01021 r MARKET GATE, "."31</p>
